          "value": "<p>The garoyasha shape-shifts into a Large wolf-humanoid hybrid form or into a Dire Wolf, or it returns to its true humanoid form. Its game statistics, other than its size, are the same in each form. Any equipment it is wearing or carrying isn't transformed.</p>",
