        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>Legendary Action Uses: 1. Immediately after another creature's turn, the garoyasha can expend a use to take the following action. The garoyasha regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns.</em></p><p>The garoyasha uses Lunar Dust.</p>",
